    "summary": "The request server's three catch sites and the queue's job runner record a store lock failure (through recordStoreFailureIfLockError) before the error is reduced to a message, and answer or log LmdbStoreLocksLostError. The periodic reader check now probes the store with one read and records a failure; the daemon starts it through startPeriodicReaderCheck, whose interval the test shortens. As recorded on the design, a lock failure on a read is code -30775 or code 22 with MDB_BAD_RSLOT.",
